## Insert — Build the Knowledge Graph

This chunks the text, extracts entities, builds the graph, and detects communities.

::: {#insert .cell cache='true' execution_count=5}
``` {.python .cell-code}
print("Indexing...")
start = time.time()
await rag.ainsert(text)
elapsed = time.time() - start
print(f"Done in {elapsed:.1f}s")
```

